# Claims Review Notes

Changed or softened:

- Unsupported performance claims changed to targets or hypotheses.
- `HIPAA compliant` language changed to `HIPAA-aligned`, `HIPAA-conscious`, or `design target`.
- Prototype disclaimers added to demo pages.
- Legal placeholder pages added.

Keep off the public site until substantiated:

- Patient satisfaction percentages.
- Adherence lift claims.
- Reduced ADE claims.
- End-to-end encryption claims unless technically true.
- HIPAA compliant claims unless reviewed by counsel and backed by operational controls, BAAs, policies, and vendor agreements.
- Any claim that the AI diagnoses, prescribes, or tells patients to stop medication.
